	"Description": "Reference Game Mod SDK for the ModFrameworkSample game. This is the public modding surface a game developer distributes to mod authors: game-specific APIs, extension points, base classes, events and data assets. It depends on ModFramework and exposes no proprietary game implementation. Each real game generates its own SDK from this shape.",
